[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748833882","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104559#issuecomment-2748833882","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104559","id":2748833882,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j1-Ba","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T17:06:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T17:06:46Z","body":"This would require actually investigating what these limits actually are and what they should be, these might be arbitrary or hardware based, and aren't necessarily wrong based on not being a product of the sizes","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748833882/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748943750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104559#issuecomment-2748943750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104559","id":2748943750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j2Y2G","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T17:43:25Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T17:44:19Z","body":"- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95204#issuecomment-2627447770.\n\nModern GPUs (NVIDIA Ampere and later) support textures up to 32768×32768, but it's unadvised to use such large textures due to poor compatibility. However, if you're only processing Images on the CPU without intending to display them as-is on the screen, it's fine to use larger dimensions.\n\nI'd go for increasing `MAX_PIXELS` personally.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748943750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748948717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104559#issuecomment-2748948717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104559","id":2748948717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j2aDt","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T17:45:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T17:45:55Z","body":"For the maximum number of pixels this is likely down to the maximum number of possible indexeable pixels using a signed 32 bit number, with 64 bits per pixel\n\nSo this wouldn't be possible as `2^28 * 64` is `2^31`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748948717/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751184779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104559#issuecomment-2751184779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104559","id":2751184779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j-7-L","user":{"login":"Motioneer","id":10763179,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzYzMTc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10763179?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer","html_url":"https://github.com/Motioneer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Motioneer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T13:00:57Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T13:00:57Z","body":"As I am lacking the necessary background knowledge, I went for a naïve test.\nI increased the MAX_PIXELS value to 281474976710656 and compiled a build.\nSo far everything works as expected. Loading images with the dimensions 40k x 20k works without any issues.\nThis is of course not an extensive test, but I wanted to share this anyway.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751184779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751195032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104559#issuecomment-2751195032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104559","id":2751195032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j--eY","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T13:03:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T13:03:41Z","body":"At least some code in `Image` uses `int` as the access type so this might not work correctly","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751195032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065912792","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104559#issuecomment-3065912792","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104559","id":3065912792,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62vh3Y","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T17:54:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T17:54:43Z","body":"I've spent some time going over the code, and yeah, there are a lot of places that can overflow due to uint32_t usage. At least some Image functionality can have integer overflows with any single dimension in pixels over 2^16 (even a 1 x 70k image) or with at least 2^32 total bytes. The single dimension limits look relatively easy to upgrade (or not notice if you're not using specific functionality), the overflows are only in a few places; the 2^32 size limit, on the other hand, is assumed in about half of the code.\n\nSo really, the current width and height are actually larger than than is fully supported, and the max pixel limit really should depend on the pixel size: if we assume a max pixel size of 64 bytes, then the MAX_PIXELS value is correct. It probably makes the most sense to just fully support images up to 2^32 bytes and remove the per dimension limits by fixing the overflows.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065912792/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]